      {
        "text": "RT-Labs AB C-Open CANopen contains a NULL pointer dereference and a write protection bypass vulnerability. These vulnerabilities can potentially crash the device or allow any CANopen node to overwrite read-only OD entries using two SDO frames.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed in 1.1.1.",
